Optional Xposed APK dependencies and display reference
----------------------------------------------------
Only the optional Manager APK uses RoxyHook, LibXposed, miuix and the
HyperSpectrum display adaptation. They are not part of the pure-Java SDK AAR
or the native capture implementation. Their attribution and Apache-2.0 license
texts are packaged in the APK under assets/open_source_licenses/.

RoxyHook: NekoStash/RoxyHook, published JitPack commit 24b1267db5.
LibXposed: libxposed API/service 102.0.0; API is compile-only.
miuix: compose-miuix-ui/miuix 0.9.4, Maven Central.
HyperSpectrum: wxxsfxyzm/HyperSpectrum at
cff6b634b34614531a5a9ce7cc96bf43bc7e3efa. Only display response, motion,
rendering and island compatibility ideas/code are adapted; no Visualizer,
reference FFT, native audio capture or volume/AGC compensation is included.
The six bars project source-band total power; they do not reconstruct the
reference implementation's raw FFT.
